{
 "name": "compare_qwen21_allopt",
 "description": "Studio vs ComfyUI, Qwen-Image-2.1 1024px 25 steps CFG 1, every optimisation on: the cells of temp/q21_allopt_run.sh (qwen21_studio_bench.py + qwen21_comfy_legb.py), interleaved Studio / ComfyUI in the same order, a GPU gate before each. Pass p1 = 24 prompts (quality + timing), p2 = 8 (timing repeat). Quality is scored against each framework's OWN bf16 T0 cell; the cross-framework bf16 LPIPS is a floor only (different noise). T0 = defaults, T1 = compile + fast kernels (+ sage), T2 = T1 + step cache (Studio fbcache, ComfyUI EasyCache 0.2). ComfyUI files are Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1's own; Studio loads the diffusers snapshot. To reproduce the original run exactly on its host, reuse its interpreters: DIFFUSION_BENCH_STUDIO_PYTHON=$WORKSPACE/temp/venv_qwen21/bin/python, DIFFUSION_BENCH_COMFY_PYTHON=$WORKSPACE/temp/venv_qwen21/bin/python, DIFFUSION_BENCH_COMFY_DIR=$WORKSPACE/ComfyUI_q21.",
 "defaults": {
  "kind": "image",
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "steps": 25,
  "guidance": 1.0,
  "prompts": "image_24",
  "n": 24,
  "warmup": 1,
  "short_steps": 5,
  "short_n": 3
 },
 "passes": [
  {
   "name": "pass1",
   "n": 24
  },
  {
   "name": "pass2",
   "n": 8
  }
 ],
 "gate": {
  "max_util": 10,
  "min_free_mib": 100000,
  "timeout_s": 1800
 },
 "reference": {
  "studio": "s_bf16_T0",
  "comfyui": "c_bf16_T0"
 },
